    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A drake that used to be a guardian of Aden in ancient times, but turned into a devil of revenge after losing his child to a greedy hunter. He has left Dragon Valley to roam the territories near Aden Castle, and killed countless villagers. He also killed the priests who came to calm his rage. All of his good deeds have been erased from the chronicles by Imperial command, and he is now called the Disaster of Aden. Dragons Lv. 10 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Dragons. P. Def. +5% Max HP +5% Attack Range +30 Resistance to Hold +15% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% M. Def. -5% Resistance to Sword -10% Resistance to Dual Sword -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
